    {
      "title": "A Stolen Bicycle",
      "word_count": 94,
      "text": "Yesterday, Carlos's bicycle was stolen outside his house. He called the police right away. A police officer arrived quickly and asked questions. 'Is this your bicycle?' he asked, showing a photo. 'Yes, it is!' said Carlos. A neighbor was a witness — she saw a young man take the bicycle. 'Is he a suspect?' asked the officer. 'Yes, he is,' said the neighbor. 'I can describe him.' The officer wrote a report. Carlos was worried, but the officer said the neighborhood is usually very safe. Two days later, the police found the bicycle near the police station.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "q": "What happened to Carlos's bicycle?",
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "It broke",
            "It was stolen",
            "He sold it",
            "He lost it"
          ],
          "answer": "It was stolen"
        },
        {
          "q": "Who saw the thief take the bicycle?",
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "Carlos",
            "A police officer",
            "A neighbor",
            "Nobody"
          ],
          "answer": "A neighbor"
        },
        {
          "q": "Is the neighborhood usually dangerous?",
          "type": "true_false",
          "answer": false
        },
        {
          "q": "Where did the police find the bicycle?",
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "At Carlos's house",
            "Near the police station",
            "At school",
            "In a park"
          ],
          "answer": "Near the police station"
        },
        {
          "q": "Did the officer write a report?",
          "type": "true_false",
          "answer": true
        }
      ]
    },
